{"unit_id":"lujianjun19__dsh-llm-github-copilot#feature-1","repo":"lujianjun19/dsh-llm-github-copilot","commit":"0e327a90a47595ab732e72ec38e23cad7feb9633","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GitHub Copilot 的功能「设备码登录」：在聊天命令或 Web 设置页启动 GitHub OAuth 设备流程，显示验证链接和用户码，并轮询授权结果后保存长期 token。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21-47","lib/index.js:411-463","src/client/06-login-dialog.js:1-39"]}
{"unit_id":"lujianjun19__dsh-llm-github-copilot#feature-2","repo":"lujianjun19/dsh-llm-github-copilot","commit":"0e327a90a47595ab732e72ec38e23cad7feb9633","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GitHub Copilot 的功能「凭据交接」：将长期 OAuth token 写入 Harness 内置 github-copilot 路由读取的 grant 记录，并可在凭据服务就绪时沿用已有 token。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:335-379"]}
{"unit_id":"lujianjun19__dsh-llm-github-copilot#feature-3","repo":"lujianjun19/dsh-llm-github-copilot","commit":"0e327a90a47595ab732e72ec38e23cad7feb9633","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GitHub Copilot 的功能「登录状态」：通过聊天命令或 Web 页面查看是否存在授权凭据；若下游路由已记录可用模型 ID，则显示数量。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:464-484","lib/index.js:591-616","src/client/07-settings-page.js:1-60"]}
{"unit_id":"lujianjun19__dsh-llm-github-copilot#feature-4","repo":"lujianjun19/dsh-llm-github-copilot","commit":"0e327a90a47595ab732e72ec38e23cad7feb9633","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GitHub Copilot 的功能「退出登录」：确认后删除本机 grant 及可写的 token 引用，并报告环境变量等外部来源是否仍提供凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:496-510","src/client/10-apply.js:15-37"]}
{"unit_id":"lujianjun19__dsh-llm-github-copilot#caveat-1","repo":"lujianjun19/dsh-llm-github-copilot","commit":"0e327a90a47595ab732e72ec38e23cad7feb9633","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"GitHub 登录会访问 github.com 的设备授权与 token 端点；此插件只发布凭据，实际 Copilot token 交换、模型目录和请求由 Harness 内置路由负责。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:38-40","lib/index.js:263-271"]}
{"unit_id":"lujianjun19__dsh-llm-github-copilot#caveat-2","repo":"lujianjun19/dsh-llm-github-copilot","commit":"0e327a90a47595ab732e72ec38e23cad7feb9633","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"使用需要 Harness 凭据服务和内置 github-copilot 路由。退出操作不会清除启动环境提供的 token；若外部引用仍有值，状态会显示凭据仍然存在。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:335-349","lib/index.js:496-510"]}
